WEBVTT

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.140
<b>A big rock</b>

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.900
<b>Stands in their way</b>

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.520
<b>Dawn</b>

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.740
Are you okay, Shuuyu?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.030
Y-Yeah.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.220
That's enough.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.530
Go back to be being a card.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.160
But the enemy general is still...

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.540
Don't worry.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.190
It'll be fine.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.410
I won't let this be the last 
time we see each other.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.130
Believe in me.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.920
All right.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.830
Damn it! I've gotta get out fast!

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.470
Hey! Sonshin, right?

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.160
Barini!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:39.970
You're alive?

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.500
Forget that!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.520
Where's the exit?

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.080
Ryou'un's finding it now!

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.080
Sonshin!

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.020
Trouble! Come quick!

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:53.030
Trouble? What now?

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:26.590
No good?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:27.410
Kan'u!

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:31.240
Sorry! I can't do anything in this form!

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.040
So this is it? Our only way out!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:34.840
Yes.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.670
But the collapse triggered the trap

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.740
that keeps out external enemies.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.020
Move.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:47.890
I'll bust this rock in a single hit!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:55.480
It's hopeless.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.070
Suikyou-sensei's seal is upon this rock.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.400
Our spiritual energy isn't enough...

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.280
Why didn't you tell me?

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:05.640
Hey!

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.400
Is there no other exit?

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.760
If there was, I'd be heading there now.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.220
Are you okay?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:15.590
Sonshin, what are you doing?

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:19.090
If this is the only exit, 
we don't have a choice!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:22.340
And I promised Shuuyu...

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.700
That I wouldn't let this be the last time!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.570
That won't help!

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.920
We don't know until we try, right!

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.390
Kan'u, what are you doing?

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.120
Push harder!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.460
You won't be able to keep your 
promise with your general like that!

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:39.360
Right!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.770
Is there no way to undo 
this Suikyou guy's seal?

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:45.760
H-Hey!

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.250
Power alone is not enough.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:50.870
Ryou'un!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.680
Build up your spiritual 
energy and breathe in unison.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:03.010
Believe in the power of your friends!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.650
Jeez... You guys can have fun with that!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.110
I'll find another way out—

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.700
Crap!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.230
I can't even get out this way?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.090
One more time.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:15.300
Breathe together.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.930
Friends and cooperation are stupid!

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.190
<i>Here, this is for you.</i>

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:27.370
<i>Are you sure? This was 
really important to you.</i>

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:31.250
Are you really going?

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.300
Yeah.

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:35.800
Leaving us... your friends behind?

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:36.880
Of course not.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.630
I taught you that you should risk your 
life to protect your friends, right?

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:42.620
Listen, Barini,

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.510
someday you're going to leave this place,

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:49.120
and put your life on the line for 
people you really care about.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:49.850
Got it?

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.310
No good.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.640
It's not moving at all.

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.040
Damn!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.520
Hey, you guys.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.030
Get your asses back into it.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.620
What?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.470
Is something on my face?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:10.280
Okay, let's all work together!

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:15.910
It can't be!

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:21.930
This phenomenon is a sign that the soul 
of a lord and general are becoming one.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.180
Are they perhaps capable of 
being the legendary lords,

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.820
spoken of since ancient times?

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.640
It's started moving!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.900
Almost!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:43.600
No! It came back?!

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.640
Damn it, I can't do any more!

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.800
Don't give up, you two!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.300
If you give up, it's over!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.820
That's right!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:56.580
What?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.890
Gien?

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.260
You're alive?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.830
What's going on?

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.210
Stop slacking! We're leaving!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.610
Okay, just once more!

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:08.420
Right!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.380
Almost!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.350
Okay, I can see the exit! Go!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.260
Yeah!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.340
Let's go!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.830
Get moving!

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.100
Come on!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.500
Let's go!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.360
Yeah!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.810
What are you doing?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.350
You go, too!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.240
R-Right!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.660
Come on, you too!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.160
Don't worry about me!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.870
No! I can't leave you!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.130
It's the second time I've heard those words.

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:47.660
I once had one I served forever.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:52.120
I never thought I'd hear 
those words again like this!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.140
Gien! Gien!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.040
Wait!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.980
Hey, now what?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.730
This sound... Is it...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.030
W-Water?

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:06.940
Crap!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.220
Run!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:19.080
Now, Kan'u, you are mine!

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.520
Wh-Why?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.340
Why isn't anything happening?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.550
D-Did they...

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:31.350
Did they get out?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.780
Where are we?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.460
Looks like we survived.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.790
Shuuyu!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.470
When did you get out of the card?

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.650
I don't know.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.980
I just woke up here.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.220
What are you doing here?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.100
I actually don't know myself.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.120
Are you Baryou?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.370
Who's the kid?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.150
I'm no kid!

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.680
I'm Kan'u!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.250
You shouldn't tease adults.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:08.160
I didn't know you had a general.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.160
How humiliating!

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:09.960
What does that mean?

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.310
It means there's at least one thing 
about you that's not screwed up.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.680
Are you picking a fight?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.350
I've been here before.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.180
Splendid.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.940
It's back!

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.140
Suikyou-sensei?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.150
Splendid to see you escaped!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:28.140
Who's this weirdo?

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.930
Suikyou-sensei.

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:31.060
Him?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:32.710
Suikyou?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.410
I don't see Gien here...

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.190
What happened to him?

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:42.380
I don't know.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:46.500
He did that to get us out...

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.700
Don't worry.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:52.970
If he has a bond with you, you'll meet again.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:58.050
So now I'll tell you of
your next destination.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.160
Splendid.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.680
You will head for the 
Southwest Empress's Palace.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.560
The Southwest Empress's Palace?

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.640
One of the Nine Earth Palaces,

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.070
nine shrines scattered about the land.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.960
Both the Southern Palace and 
the Southwest Empress's Palace

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:18.070
are part of the Nine Earth Palaces' number.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:21.830
What's at this Southwest Empress's Palace?

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.760
If you wish to know the answer, 
head to Seito in the land of Tenpu!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:30.090
Hey, wait! You haven't told us anything!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:34.340
Hakuanshi and his men will likely 
be heading there as well.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.880
Be ready for them.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.770
There's more stuff I want to know!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:45.840
How long will you keep me waiting?

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.980
I have half of Kan'u already.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.570
There's no need to hurry.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.730
If I wait at Seito, they'll come to me.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:58.490
Then go crush the Southwest Empress's Palace.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.310
As you wish.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.780
<i>Enjoy what time you have left, your majesty.</i>

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:10.750
Where are we?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.410
Suikyou-sensei?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.960
He's gone...

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:20.340
My grandfather is gone, along 
with the Kan'u Shrine.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.230
Ryou'un...

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.230
You're not going to the 
Southwest Empress's Palace?

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.680
Let's go.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.090
It may not be an ally that awaits us there.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:33.900
And...

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.480
Even with the palace gone, 
I can't leave this place.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:43.160
Ryou'un, I need your power.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.530
Come with me.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.910
It's too dangerous.

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:49.340
Kan'u's not at full strength, either.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.460
The two of us can't do it alone.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.720
But with three of us...

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.310
Barini!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.680
I've got a lot of questions for Hakuanshi.

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.050
Seems it's settled.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.760
That's great!

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.340
If you're with us...

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.050
I'm not interested in being friends.

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:10.410
I'll be going on ahead.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:15.210
I'm overjoyed at the chance to 
travel with such a beautiful lady.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.770
I need to hurry and get my body back.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:22.470
Yes.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.450
Okay, let's go, too.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:29.220
I'm counting on you, my lord.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.930
What did you say?

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.960
Hey, let's go!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.670
You just called me your lord, right?

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.410
Sure you didn't imagine it?

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.430
I heard it!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.480
I doubt it.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.510
Hey, Shuuyu!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.020
<b>Tomorrow</b>
